  "details": {
   "description": "Indulge in the authentic taste of Kerala with Beyond Snack's Kerala Banana Chips Original Style. Carefully crafted from ripe Nendran bananas - celebrated as the \"King of Bananas\" for their tall, long, and extra fleshy nature - these chips offer a delectable, crunchy snacking experience. The traditional preparation ensures each chip retains its natural sweetness while developing a satisfying crunch that's simply irresistible. Rich in antioxidants, vitamins C and B6, and high in fibre, these gluten-free, trans-fat-free, and non-GMO chips provide a guilt-free indulgence. Versatile and convenient, they make the perfect snack for any occasion - whether enjoyed on their own or as a delightful accompaniment to your favourite meals. Savour the true essence of Kerala with every bite of these authentic and flavourful banana chips.",
